\cf2 The mathematical precision (390 + 40 days/years) demonstrates this isn't divine caprice but covenant accountability reaching its sum. The very fact that God reveals this through his prophet before it happens proves he remains sovereign over the process.\
The signs thus serve a dual function: they explain the inexorable logic of covenant judgment while warning that all apparent escape routes (military, diplomatic, cultic, intercessory) have been sealed off as thoroughly as Ezekiel is bound by his cords.\
Marshwiggle: Ezekiel's own silence, which has at this point in the text not yet been given a duration but will extend to seven years, is also such a sign - as it corresponds to the seven days he spends overwhelmed among the people with the hand of the LORD heavy upon him, which he at least starts in bitter fury. On the day the muteness is lifted, 24:27, Ezekiel is said to be a sign to the exiles, and the purposes is given - they will know that I am the Lord. How do the three signs regarding diet contribute to this picture?\
Opus: The three dietary signs escalate from scarcity to degradation to defilement:\
