\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Persistence of precision: The measuring, weighing, and dividing by thirds appears to be how divine justice operates generally, not just within covenant administration. This undermines any attempt to limit Ezekiel's framework to Israel alone.\
\ls39\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3.	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
